# Project Context

Vite + React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind 4 frontend for the CFO exam task-management system.

## Backend services

- **Laravel API** (`VITE_LARAVEL_API_URL`): auth, users, teams, tasks — JWT in `Authorization: Bearer`
- **Node API** (`VITE_NODE_API_URL`): analytics, export — same JWT

## Live URLs (production)

- Laravel: `https://task-management-laravel-api-u2v9.onrender.com/api`
- Node: `https://task-management-node-services-g5ie.onrender.com/api`

## Test credentials

- Admin: `admin@test.com` / `password123`
