## Conventions

- Feature-sliced layout under `src/features/` — each module uses `_api`, `_components`, `_hooks`, `_service`, `_stores`, `_types`, `_utils` (see `user-management` as reference)
- Functional components + TypeScript
- Context API for auth (`user`, `token`) — avoid Redux unless necessary
- Match API response envelope: `{ status, message, data, errors? }`
- Do not hardcode secrets; use `import.meta.env.VITE_*`
- Indentation: **4 spaces** (no tabs) — enforced via `.editorconfig` and Prettier
